    """Mirrors the inline key scheme in manager_bot.py's _cls_menu_buttons/
    _cls_view_text/_cls_callback (no standalone helper function exists in
    production -- kept inline there specifically so it stays extractable by
    the pre-existing tools/closer_settings_selftest.py fixed name-set)."""
